  "description_en": "Non-Yahoo market corroboration is a quality target and a prerequisite for high-confidence model inference and uncapped valuation confidence. Temporary unavailability of free market endpoints does not erase otherwise valid multi-source company evidence and is not, by itself, a global publication blocker.",
